availableLandmarks
userLocation
C:*
*.tflite
_local

# Claude Code task tracking (local working files)
tasks/*

# React Email browser previews (regenerable via npx tsx scripts/preview-email.ts)
emails-preview/

# Local creative drafts (not committed)
drafts/

# ML model weights — never commit (auto-downloaded by ultralytics: yolo*-pose.pt, mobile_sam.pt, FastSAM-*.pt)
*.pt
# ArcFace ONNX recognition weights (~174MB, fetched at build/run time via ARCFACE_ONNX_MODEL)
*.onnx

# The clear-bug registry is TRACKED — the pre-push gate reads it on every clone
!tasks/bugs.json

# The backlog index is TRACKED for the same reason bugs.json is: it must survive.
# tasks/* is ignored so per-session scratch plans stay local — correct, but it
# also meant tasks/todo.md was untracked, and every session wrote its plan into
# that one shared filename. On 2026-08-20 one session's plan overwrote another's
# backlog and git had no copy to recover from. The index and the recovered
# backlog are durable state, not scratch.
!tasks/BACKLOG.md
!tasks/eval-variance-backlog.md
# Measured findings, not a session plan: a per-stage provenance trace of story-text
# defects (which review stage introduces which defect). Agents must be able to read it
# before touching story-arc-review / story-beats-review / text-refine.
!tasks/story-text-quality-2026-08-25.md
# The toddler-mode design record, not a session plan: BACKLOG.md and the
# decisions.md entry both point at it for the settled trigger rule and for the
# three things deliberately NOT built (reading level, refrain form, trial word
# count). Untracked, those pointers dangle for the next agent.
!tasks/toddler-mode-2026-08-25.md
